Package: SuSiEUTL
Type: Package
Title: Theta-Coordinate Multi-Ancestry SuSiE from Sufficient Statistics
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(given = "SuSiEUTL", family = "Development Team", email = "not-set@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: SuSiEUTL Development Team [aut, cre]
Maintainer: SuSiEUTL Development Team <not-set@example.org>
Description: Phase-one theta-coordinate multi-ancestry SuSiE inference from
    centered and standardized sufficient statistics. The package uses fixed
    theta covariance components, exact joint SNP-by-component SER updates,
    finite IBSS, optional residual-variance estimation, and direct theta and
    observed-beta posterior diagnostics.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
